      "id": "claim_a69733866d5f4d1eb89704fb0a2dc3bf",
      "statement": "k8s-gateway provides internal DNS resolution for Kubernetes resources, exposing a LoadBalancer service on static IP 192.168.50.11 assigned via Cilium IPAM annotation. It watches HTTPRoute and Service resources, generating DNS records for SECRET_DOMAIN with 1-second TTL, enabling cluster-internal service discovery.",
