    {
      "id": "claim_a482503dde524ac9b5025763eab59269",
      "statement": "Tailscale operator (v1.98.9) provides secure mesh networking with OAuth authentication from tailscale-secret. The operator is configured with hostname 'tailscale' and API server proxy enabled. Egress proxy functionality enables accessing external Tailnet resources via ExternalName services annotated with Tailnet IPs.",
