    {
      "id": "claim_af9546e7cb744df696ac7a489a3f147b",
      "statement": "External ingress traffic flows from users through DNS resolution to Cloudflare Tunnel endpoint, then via Cloudflare Edge to the tunnel, which forwards HTTP/2 traffic to the external Cilium Gateway (192.168.50.13). The gateway routes HTTPRoutes to backend services via Cilium's BPF load balancing. Cloudflare External DNS manages DNS records for exposed services.",
